{% from "partials/icon.njk" import icon %}
<section class="cta">
  <div class="container cta__inner">
    <h2>Ready to stop fighting your IT?</h2>
    <p>Talk to a real engineer in under 24 hours. Honest ballpark pricing before you commit. No long-term lock-in.</p>
    <div class="cta__actions">
      <a href="tel:{{ site.phonePrimaryHref }}" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">{{ icon("headset", 18) }} {{ site.phonePrimary }}</a>
      <a href="/contact-us/" class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg">Send a message</a>
    </div>
    <div class="next-steps">
      <div class="next-step">
        <h3>A 15-minute conversation</h3>
        <p>You talk, we listen. What's working, what's breaking, what it's costing you. No pitch, no jargon.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="next-step">
        <h3>A plain-language assessment</h3>
        <p>We tell you what we found, what we'd fix first, and a ballpark number — so you can decide with real information.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="next-step">
        <h3>A fixed plan, in writing</h3>
        <p>If we're a fit, you get a written quote with exact pricing and a clear scope. If we're not, we'll say so.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
